This distribution bundles the Clockchain agent-handshake helper
(clockchain-agent-handshake.cjs) under assets/. The helper is acquired
and digest-pinned at install time: its bytes are verified against the
release pin (assets/pin.json) and manifest (assets/manifest.json) before
it is ever executed, and the published package ships those verified bytes
so no executable code is fetched at runtime. Third-party components
embedded in the bundled helper are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.
